# Guardian IdentityOps - .gitignore
#
# Never commit credentials, secrets, tokens, or real personal data to this
# repository. Any Azure/Entra tenant secrets, service principal credentials,
# API keys, or connection strings must be stored in Azure Key Vault or a
# local, untracked configuration file - never in source control.

# Secrets and credentials
.env
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.cer
*.secret
secrets/
credentials/

# Logs and temp output (may contain account/environment detail)
logs/
temp/
*.log

# Never commit:
#  - passwords
#  - Azure client secrets / tenant secrets
#  - access tokens / refresh tokens
#  - private keys or certificates
#  - real personal information of any kind
